# The libairmini revision airsupply builds against.
#
# Pinned by commit rather than tracked, because this is the protocol
# implementation for a medical device: a build that silently picks up new
# framing or a changed handshake is not something to discover at 3am.
#
# Bumping it is a one-line diff, and the diff is the review.
